WEBVTT

00:10:59.697 --> 00:11:01.990
For me, twerking ain’t a trend.

00:11:02.157 --> 00:11:04.410
My body is not a trend.

00:11:05.077 --> 00:11:06.745
I twerk for the strippers,

00:11:06.745 --> 00:11:07.871
for the video vixens,

00:11:07.871 --> 00:11:09.498
for the church ladies who shout --

00:11:09.498 --> 00:11:10.624
for the sex workers.

00:11:11.625 --> 00:11:14.253
I twerk because Black women
are undeniable.

00:11:15.421 --> 00:11:17.005
I twerk for my ancestors,

00:11:17.005 --> 00:11:18.507
for sexual liberation,

00:11:18.507 --> 00:11:19.508
for my bitches --

00:11:19.508 --> 00:11:21.135
hey, girl --

00:11:21.135 --> 00:11:22.845
because I can,

00:11:22.845 --> 00:11:24.805
because I know I look good.

00:11:25.639 --> 00:11:28.475
I twerk because it’s unique
to the Black experience.

00:11:28.642 --> 00:11:30.060
It’s unique to my culture,